  "notes": "GAAP. Governmental lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p5-6, continued page). Beginning fund balance 24,827,156 with Error Correction 4,792,585 (Note 16) as an adjustment. Bond discount and insurance recoveries combined into other_financing. Business-type from the proprietary Totals column (p9-10) before the internal service fund consolidation adjustment (business-type activities net position 39,010,228 after +27,600 adjustment); no single total printed, so receipts = operating + nonoperating revenues and disbursements = operating expenses + interest expense. Internal service funds (p18-19) are not recorded (not governmental funds and not enterprise). Miscellaneous taxes (3,111,540, mostly Streets Fund) kept as other taxes; no breakdown printed. Detail: budget schedules for General, Economic Development and Special Projects funds (budget basis); nonmajor combining statement has 10 funds, so its Total column is recorded as 'Nonmajor funds (combined)'. Debt Service, Streets and Capital Projects funds and the enterprise funds have no supplementary schedule, so no detail lines. Read pages 1-19 of 19"
}
